  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "0d8b9b9e72135c5c",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "小冒险家丁一一小朋友，你好呀！我是泡泡！欢迎来到星绒岛！这里有软绵绵的云朵、闪闪的星星，还有好多可爱的精灵朋友。丁一一，点一下进入梦幻小岛，我们一起去冒险吧！",
      "context": "开场/试听",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/0d8b9b9e72135c5c.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "359f33f619b8b4d8",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "小冒险家丁一一小朋友，欢迎来到星绒岛奇遇记！我是泡泡，你最最可爱的冒险伙伴。点一下进入梦幻小岛，我们出发啦！",
      "context": "开场/试听",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/359f33f619b8b4d8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad4b40a3606a85bc",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "丁一一小朋友，你好呀！我是泡泡！听到我的声音了吗？我们一起去星绒岛冒险吧！",
      "context": "开场/试听",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/ad4b40a3606a85bc.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "dae00df5c697cc2c",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "送给丁一一小朋友。欢迎来到星绒岛奇遇记。这是一个有精灵、有魔法、也有温柔故事的小世界。",
      "context": "童话旁白试听",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/dae00df5c697cc2c.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "7f119ff44237bfd9",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "丁一一，你真棒！我们又收集到闪闪的小星光啦！",
      "context": "通关祝贺",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/7f119ff44237bfd9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8262b518477899b",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "丁一一，我们来看看今天的小任务吧！",
      "context": "任务引导",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/f8262b518477899b.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "883fd2b82c74b723",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "欢迎来到星绒岛，今天会发生哪些奇妙的童话故事呢？",
      "context": "场景介绍",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/883fd2b82c74b723.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2686e5bedd44140",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "小冒险家丁一一小朋友，欢迎来到星绒岛！我是泡泡，从今天开始我们就是好朋友啦！点一点我，我们一起去找闪闪的星星吧！",
      "context": "互动：泡泡",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/b2686e5bedd44140.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2868d8a768b5185",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "我最喜欢和你一起找星星啦！今天要不要去花园看看？对啦，点一下星光树会有惊喜哦！",
      "context": "互动：泡泡",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/e2868d8a768b5185.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ee1e54e0297999df",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "谢谢你唤醒我，勇敢的小守护者！从今天开始，花朵和云朵都会陪你旅行。",
      "context": "互动：彩虹星树",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/ee1e54e0297999df.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "e864afe2670fac54",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "每一颗小小的善意，都会变成亮晶晶的星光。继续享受星绒岛的美好吧！",
      "context": "互动：彩虹星树",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/e864afe2670fac54.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "06cef252fd24137b",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "你好呀……森林里藏着三颗闪亮的橡果。可以和我一起找到它们吗？我想做一个小花环送你！",
      "context": "互动：栗栗",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/06cef252fd24137b.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ced9274dccb6fb9b",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "你真的找到了全部橡果！我以后想一直陪你冒险，可以吗？",
      "context": "互动：栗栗",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/ced9274dccb6fb9b.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6896daf713dd7a6",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "把小种子放在花圃里，轻轻浇点水，就会长出一朵神奇的花！",
      "context": "互动：花仙子莉莉",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/c6896daf713dd7a6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a99227f89c2d60f",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "嘘……萤火虫正准备开一场小舞会。你可以画一幅星空画送给它们！",
      "context": "互动：森林蘑菇",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/3a99227f89c2d60f.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a598df7c581309b1",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "在月光下，所有的声音都可以变成旋律。想跟我一起弹一首歌吗？",
      "context": "互动：月芽",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/a598df7c581309b1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb6b41539515c4bf",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "呼噜……我闻到了草莓蛋糕的香味！你也会制作魔法甜点吗？",
      "context": "互动：呼噜",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/eb6b41539515c4bf.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ee36c75bc6dd6cfb",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "星星学堂第一课：每个人都有属于自己的魔法，善良就是最厉害的一种。",
      "context": "互动：魔法故事书",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/ee36c75bc6dd6cfb.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "43f982c9b9890f1c",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "七种温柔的颜色，连接着每一颗小小的心。",
      "context": "互动：彩虹桥",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/43f982c9b9890f1c.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1d4ee4bccb3ea4c",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "我帮你收集了一点星光。愿你今天遇到美好的事情！",
      "context": "互动：水晶精灵",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/d1d4ee4bccb3ea4c.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "4653644f5c00999a",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "一封信从云端飘下来：亲爱的星星守护者，谢谢你让这里变得那么温柔。",
      "context": "随机故事：彩虹邮差",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/4653644f5c00999a.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c9310e1fe9552a4",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "咦？是谁放在树下的小包裹？里面是好多亮晶晶的星星！",
      "context": "随机故事：泡泡",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/7c9310e1fe9552a4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "9eb1c5bb812e68e5",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "微风穿过小屋，把每个小朋友的微笑都编成了旋律。",
      "context": "随机故事：风铃精灵",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/9eb1c5bb812e68e5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "890dfdea5f2b8f71",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "今天采到了最香的花蜜，我想邀请你来参加花园的下午茶！",
      "context": "随机故事：蜜蜂妮妮",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/890dfdea5f2b8f71.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "9816350673a6f93f",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "蝴蝶说：希望每一朵花都有机会和太阳说早安。",
      "context": "随机故事：彩蝶小姐",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/9816350673a6f93f.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "d0797c116bd18eec",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "一阵风吹过，花瓣在空中排成了一颗大大的爱心！",
      "context": "随机故事：花仙子莉莉",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/d0797c116bd18eec.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "49ceb2b99ce658e0",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "今晚的森林舞会没有门票，只要带着开心的心情就能参加！",
      "context": "随机故事：萤火虫乐队",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/49ceb2b99ce658e0.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "7cba0405d21ea8f5",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "我不敢和别人说话，但今天鼓起勇气对你说了第一声你好。",
      "context": "随机故事：蘑菇布布",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/7cba0405d21ea8f5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "97d5a7c696dd495b",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "栗栗悄悄做了一个蝴蝶结：谢谢你愿意陪着我冒险。",
      "context": "随机故事：栗栗",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/97d5a7c696dd495b.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c3aa346b105d838",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "每当有人许下一个善良的愿望，湖水就会多亮起一颗星星。",
      "context": "随机故事：星星鱼",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/0c3aa346b105d838.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "87cc7126844c17ea",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "漂流瓶里写着：你和世界都拥有独一无二的光。",
      "context": "随机故事：月芽",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/87cc7126844c17ea.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "9e46e222437bf568",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "咚！叮！沙沙！荷叶和露珠演奏了一首特别的清晨交响曲。",
      "context": "随机故事：青蛙小乐手",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/9e46e222437bf568.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ca8921ff9b60d83d",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "书页飞呀飞，最后拼出一句话：真正厉害的魔法，是分享和关心。",
      "context": "随机故事：魔法故事书",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/ca8921ff9b60d83d.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "603e2e40ba54b3db",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "阿嚏！呼噜一不小心打了个喷嚏，竟然喷出了七个颜色的小泡泡！",
      "context": "随机故事：呼噜",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/603e2e40ba54b3db.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "88911ec925cda7ba",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "今天的魔法咒语是：勇敢试一试！没有什么比好奇更珍贵。",
      "context": "随机故事：魔法老师",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/88911ec925cda7ba.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c74a993202a830ae",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "对着溪谷说一句喜欢的话，彩虹就会把它送给整个天空。",
      "context": "随机故事：彩虹小精灵",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/c74a993202a830ae.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "6238717a94af84c0",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "一条云朵做的小船载着三朵小花，正在寻找今天最漂亮的风景。",
      "context": "随机故事：云船长",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/6238717a94af84c0.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "0edcb088041467a4",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "叮的一声，水晶对你眨了眨眼睛：发现美好的你，也是一个小小的奇迹。",
      "context": "随机故事：水晶精灵",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/0edcb088041467a4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "103b2aa82dcf68df",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "这次的任务是：和泡泡交个朋友。在广场找到粉粉的小云朵，轻轻点它。",
      "context": "任务",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/103b2aa82dcf68df.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a64b3ddcef28b12b",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "星光故事书。和泡泡交个朋友。在广场找到粉粉的小云朵，轻轻点它。",
      "context": "星光故事书",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/a64b3ddcef28b12b.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "99be3fbb2bf6d30a",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "这次的任务是：唤醒星光树。点击广场中央发着光的彩虹星树。",
      "context": "任务",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/99be3fbb2bf6d30a.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1c17867f0fe3f67",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "星光故事书。唤醒星光树。点击广场中央发着光的彩虹星树。",
      "context": "星光故事书",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/c1c17867f0fe3f67.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "0f8754a071b0c7bf",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "这次的任务是：种下第一朵花。去花语庭院，点一块花圃，种一颗种子。",
      "context": "任务",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/0f8754a071b0c7bf.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a8401653a60caab7",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "星光故事书。种下第一朵花。去花语庭院，点一块花圃，种一颗种子。",
      "context": "星光故事书",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/a8401653a60caab7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "470193c9e8205fd0",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "这次的任务是：发现第一份乐趣。点下方「玩游戏」，任选一个小游戏完成。",
      "context": "任务",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/470193c9e8205fd0.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ffbeb6f9ba8b4367",
      "role": "narrator",
      "text": "星光故事书。发现第一份乐趣。点下方「玩游戏」，任选一个小游戏完成。",
      "context": "星光故事书",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/ffbeb6f9ba8b4367.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3b0e997810ebf1f",
      "role": "bubble",
      "text": "这次的任务是：前往糖果森林。点击「地图」，找到糖果森林，开始探险。",
      "context": "任务",
      "voice_name": "活泼女孩 2.0",
      "provider": "Voxy 语界",
      "file": "assets/voice/lively-girl/a3b0e997810ebf1f.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e15a9e415583e0b",
      "role": "narrator",
